{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36882","headline":"蜂 · 罗隐","name":"蜂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不论平地与山尖，无限风光尽被占。\n采得百花成蜜後，爲谁辛苦爲谁甜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷六五六、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》罗隐条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}